{"title":"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem A","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e11cd80f02e1772504be0e247a6e5770032f3894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{k + 4} = 1024$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/c/e2c0b9b7c265cc005dcfb7d21f4d392453aafca9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1024 = 2^{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/a/dda08fc7a262e4ff814f1a0f2aff9ab73b0ea22d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{k + 4} = 2^{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Because the bases are equal, we can set the exponents equal to each other:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/c/a0c8f534b6ea1bb987244d359ccdbb54245d3928.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k + 4 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/5/c25a627cd4cb543dcb35b6f518d14e68bffb59e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 10 - 4 = \\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"130\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC\">2015 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 C (page does not exist)\">Relay 0 Problem C</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem B (page does not exist)\">Relay 1 Problem B</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1\">Individual 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2 (page does not exis